            "title": "iPower™ Intelligent Battery Management System",
            "text": "<p>With iPower™ intelligent power control. Power delivery is automatically adjusted according to the grass conditions. Delivering extra power in tougher conditions and reserving battery life during lighter cutting. See the battery charge level at the touch of a button and manually increase the power if and when needed.</p>",
